  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nLogic: (3rd number **×** 2) - 1st number = 2nd number.\n\n(6, 22, 14)\n\n→ 14 × 2 - 6 = 22.\n\n(8, 30, 19)\n\n→ 19 × 2 - 8 = 30.\n\nSimilarly, for **(4, 18, 11)**\n\n**→ 11 × 2 - 4 = 18.**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 2\"**.\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/c76c13ba2d2ab46b47f8a931ae621dac081a0cb266b142dc23f58659fac4a466.png] **__Alternate Method__**\n\nLogic : ** 3rd number - (1st number ÷ 2) = 2nd number ÷ 2**\n\n**Given :**\n\n__\n \n• (6, 22, 14)\n\n​14 - **6 ÷ 2**__ = 22 ÷ 2\n\n14 - 3 = 11\n\n11 = 11 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• (8, 30, 19)​\n\n​19 - **8** ÷ 2__ = 30 ÷ 2\n\n19 - 4 = 15\n\n15 = 15 (LHS = RHS)\n\n​So,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : (12, 46, 27)​\n\n​27 - **12** ÷ 2__ = 46 ÷ 2\n\n27 - 6 = 23\n\n**21 ≠ 23 (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : (4, 18, 11)​\n\n​11 - **4** ÷ 2__ = 18 ÷ 2\n\n11 - 2 = 9\n\n**9 = 9 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : (7, 26, 17)​\n\n​17 - 7 ÷ 2__ = 26 ÷ 2\n\n17 - 3.5 = 13\n\n13.5 ≠ 13 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : (9, 34, 22)​\n\n​22 - 9 ÷ 2__ = 34 ÷ 2\n\n22 - 4.5 = 17\n\n17.5 ≠ 17 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, **\"Option - (2)\"** is the correct answer.\n\n3c:T19fc,\n\nयहा",
